        "summary": "## Read-only audit result\n\nNo files were modified.\n\n### Current visible project inventory\n\nThe non-ignored project file listing contains only these product-visible files:\n\n- `docs/architecture-details.md`\n- `docs/architecture-overview.md`\n- `docs/gia-doan-1.md`\n- `docs/myseo-architecture-principles.md`\n- `docs/myseo-development-roadmap.md`\n- `docs/myseo-owner-decisions.md`\n- `docs/myseo-product-direction.md`\n\nThe tree also contains:\n\n- `.forge/` — runtime, schemas, workflow, and control files; explicitly identified by the project documentation as infrastructure, not product source.\n- `workflows/` — directory present, with no product files shown.\n\n### Source/build/test/package status\n\nNo current product files were found for:\n\n- Plugin entry point: `myseoforall.php`\n- Composer: `composer.json`, `composer.lock`\n- PHPUnit: `phpunit.xml`\n- Product source: `src/`\n- Product tests: `tests/`\n- Translation files: `languages/`\n- Build/package configuration: `package.json`, Vite configuration, build scripts\n- Generated artifacts: `vendor/`, `dist/`, `production/`, `node_modules/`\n\nTherefore, there are no current implementation symbols, classes, functions, test cases, package manifests, or build artifacts available for inspection.\n\nThe inspected Markdown files report `symbol_map: []`, `code_graph: {}`, and `index_status: unavailable`; their code blocks are documentation examples rather than indexed source symbols.\n\n## Phase 1 files that are safe to plan/create\n\n`docs/gia-doan-1.md` gives the following as an initial proposed structure, not an implementation manifest:\n\n```text\nmyseoforall.php\ncomposer.json\nphpunit.xml\nREADME.md\nCHANGELOG.md\n\nsrc/\n  Core/\n    Plugin.php\n    Container.php\n    Contracts/\n    Configuration/\n    Support/\n  Admin/\n    AdminModule.php\n    Notices/\n  WooCommerce/\n    WooCommerceModule.php\n  Infrastructure/\n    WordPress/\n    Persistence/\n\ntests/\n  Unit/\n  Integration/\n\nlanguages/\n```\n\nThese paths are safe candidates for Phase 1 creation because no conflicting product files or directories were found. The documentation also explicitly says to create only modules with real behavior and not a collection of empty directories. No files were created during this audit.\n\nExisting files that can be inspected are limited to the seven Markdown documents under `docs/`. The proposed Phase 1 source files themselves do not yet exist.\n\n## Relevant retained evidence\n\n| Path | SHA-256 |\n|---|---|\n| `docs/gia-doan-1.md` | `f13f4340dfacf7490c6aac7b5ae2dc2b9a9db504daef4e06b678bb33bca37978` |\n| `docs/myseo-development-roadmap.md` | `f7664d861f3cbabce1b88b6391d448fa5859e8f2521c9caf94ffb93ed601f5d6` |\n| `docs/architecture-overview.md` | `c9e3deffbf3d4e3a2945b70f7f130057049623bf52086da92253aecf08ed58b9` |\n| `docs/architecture-details.md` | `0a39ee548bc4e5d375987bccb7fa3ae1146f16f4954e8401df1be00688518456` |\n| `docs/myseo-architecture-principles.md` | `506f22d0ca4f38a0b6bf5fdccc2bcffc6303df4f73ac8b9cfdef8391618853da` |\n| `docs/myseo-owner-decisions.md` | `4b2ebe6398af186d19f80e85527fdd8a70f4c1583c66f792acfbcbc3e9a5b147` |\n| `docs/myseo-product-direction.md` | `697828383abbfdbe3d92886c3abd293fdf0b36d8e243e2af070803afaf6188d6` |\n\n### Relevant documented sections\n\n- `docs/gia-doan-1.md`\n  - Bootstrap\n  - Dependency and module availability\n  - Composition root and module lifecycle\n  - Configuration and persistence\n  - Lifecycle and migration\n  - Security and permissions\n  - Settings and Health Check\n- `docs/myseo-development-roadmap.md`\n  - “Giai đoạn 1 — Nền móng plugin”\n  - Minimum quality matrix\n- `docs/myseo-owner-decisions.md`\n  - “Ảnh hưởng tới Giai đoạn 1”\n  - WooCommerce, Rank Math, Anthropic, privacy, and output-ownership constraints\n- `docs/myseo-architecture-principles.md`\n  - Composition-root and module-boundary rules\n  - Non-negotiable guardrails\n- `docs/myseo-product-direction.md`\n  - Current-project context\n  - MVP scope and product constraints\n\n## Limitations and conclusion\n\n`docs/architecture-overview.md` and `docs/architecture-details.md` describe a different, older plugin named `document`; their references to `plugin.php`, `core/`, `src/`, tests, and build files are historical documentation, not evidence that those paths exist here. `docs/myseo-product-direction.md` confirms that this project starts nearly from zero and that `.forge/` is not product scope.\n\n**Conclusion:** the project currently contains planning/architecture documentation and Forge infrastructure only. No Phase 1 source, build, test, or package implementation exists yet. The proposed Phase 1 paths above can be created later, but exact filenames beneath the placeholder directories should be finalized from concrete behavior/contracts rather than from the documentation alone.",
